SUMMARY:The Art of Not Letting Go
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:The Art of Not Letting Go is a comedy poetry show performed by 
 Richard Thomson\, a man deep into his fifth decade\, taking in everything f
 rom his first kiss to his first child\, to the inexplicable meanders that l
 ed him to roam the aisles of Lidl seeking salvation. There are poems about 
 lost chances\, lost love and lost partners (in IKEA). Described by Spork Sp
 oken Word as 'Fabulously uplifting\, warm\, joyous and very funny'\, Richar
 d is a multiple poetry slam champion who has headlined poetry events across
  the south west of England.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atla
 s/event/the-art-of-not-letting-go/
URL:https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/the-art-of-not-letting-go/
